WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.170
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.440 --> 01:44.600
NEW MESSAGE

3
01:51.520 --> 01:53.200
There's a campground nearby.

4
01:53.280 --> 01:55.720
I'll wait for you there. There's something I need to tell you.

5
02:26.960 --> 02:30.360
ZHUANG NING

6
02:33.320 --> 02:34.720
ZHUANG NING

7
02:39.880 --> 02:42.800
Hello, the number you have dialed is powered off.

8
03:08.120 --> 03:09.560
GO STRAIGHT 102 M

9
03:36.080 --> 03:39.200
VISITOR REST AREA

10
03:49.000 --> 03:50.280
Zhuang Ning.

11
03:53.080 --> 03:54.120
Zhuang Ning!

12
04:03.320 --> 04:05.880
Hello, the number you have dialed is powered off.

13
04:54.120 --> 04:56.320
-Zheng Yu. -What are you doing here?

14
04:57.920 --> 04:59.680
I was about to ask you the same thing.

15
04:59.760 --> 05:04.680
TWENTY MINUTES AGO

16
05:07.160 --> 05:08.560
What's the matter?

17
05:08.640 --> 05:09.840
It's already late.

18
05:09.920 --> 05:11.640
Whatever it is, tell me when you get back.

19
05:13.360 --> 05:14.760
I HURT MY FOOT, YOU…

20
06:38.720 --> 06:41.800
Hello, the number you have dialed is powered off.

21
07:00.080 --> 07:01.480
Your gear is surprisingly complete.

22
07:03.520 --> 07:05.240
Since you couldn't reach Zhuang Ning,

23
07:05.320 --> 07:07.440
why didn't you ask the group leader to help look for her?

24
07:08.680 --> 07:10.600
I'm not even sure if Zhuang Ning is missing.

25
07:11.560 --> 07:13.520
And she's not the type to send messages randomly.

26
07:14.640 --> 07:17.640
What if something really happened and she wanted to talk to me in private?

27
07:18.400 --> 07:22.240
Besides, this is a developed tourist area. It's not that dangerous.

28
07:22.960 --> 07:24.400
Since you turned her down,

29
07:25.040 --> 07:27.720
maybe she saw your message and decided not to come.

30
07:27.800 --> 07:29.600
Or maybe you just missed each other on the way.

31
07:30.960 --> 07:32.000
That's possible.

32
07:37.840 --> 07:39.440
Did you bump into something? Let me see.

33
07:39.520 --> 07:40.360
I'm fine.

34
07:48.320 --> 07:49.720
It's just a minor scrape.

35
07:49.800 --> 07:51.000
Wait.

36
07:52.400 --> 07:53.760
This scar…

37
07:55.000 --> 07:56.400
How did you get it?

38
07:58.880 --> 08:01.880
After high school graduation, I got into a fight with someone. It left a scar.

39
08:04.160 --> 08:05.040
You get into fights?

40
08:06.520 --> 08:08.240
I fought back when someone beat me up.

41
08:08.920 --> 08:10.360
I guess that counts as a fight.

42
08:12.400 --> 08:13.440
Who beat you up?

43
08:14.920 --> 08:15.800
Debt collectors.

44
08:19.640 --> 08:21.240
Those two at the hospital last time?

45
08:23.240 --> 08:26.240
My uncle was the one who introduced them to me.

46
08:26.320 --> 08:28.160
I was naïve back then.

47
08:28.240 --> 08:29.880
I believed he genuinely wanted to help me,

48
08:29.960 --> 08:31.560
only to realize later that

49
08:31.640 --> 08:33.919
the more money he gave me, the more I owed.

50
08:34.000 --> 08:37.840
But my mom's surgery failed, and I couldn't pay them back.

51
08:45.200 --> 08:48.480
Dodge! Come on, dodge!

52
08:49.160 --> 08:50.840
Dodge!

53
09:32.560 --> 09:34.880
Next time you can't call the group leader,

54
09:36.040 --> 09:37.000
just call me instead.

55
09:40.760 --> 09:42.240
At least now,

56
09:43.920 --> 09:45.920
we can call ourselves friends, right?

57
11:20.200 --> 11:21.080
Zheng Yu.

58
11:23.560 --> 11:24.400
Zheng Yu.

59
11:35.520 --> 11:36.960
The rain's stopped. Let's head back.

60
12:09.840 --> 12:12.360
You're here early. It's not time for class yet.

61
12:13.360 --> 12:14.640
That's right.

62
12:14.720 --> 12:17.560
I just woke up with nothing to do, so I wanted to read for a bit.

63
12:18.720 --> 12:20.080
As expected of a top university!

64
12:20.160 --> 12:22.640
One of your classmates stayed up all night writing a report here.

65
12:22.720 --> 12:24.560
She didn't even realize the door had been locked.

66
12:24.640 --> 12:27.680
I only let her out when I came to clean this morning.

67
12:27.760 --> 12:29.800
-Stayed up writing a report? -That's right.

68
12:30.960 --> 12:33.600
University students these days really have it tough.

69
12:35.040 --> 12:36.240
They sure do.

70
12:37.240 --> 12:38.720
I'll let you get back to work, ma'am.

71
12:39.560 --> 12:42.520
I'll go check the kitchen to see if breakfast is ready.

72
12:47.720 --> 12:49.840
You go in first, and I'll follow you.

73
12:54.280 --> 12:56.880
ACADEMIC BUILDING

74
13:13.120 --> 13:13.960
Go on.

75
13:28.960 --> 13:31.600
Did you go to the campground last night?

76
13:32.520 --> 13:33.440
The campground?

77
13:33.520 --> 13:36.920
You texted me to meet you there because you had something to tell me.

78
13:37.520 --> 13:38.920
I went,

79
13:39.000 --> 13:40.120
but I didn't see you there.

80
13:41.520 --> 13:42.360
Your phone.

81
13:45.360 --> 13:46.400
Let me borrow it.

82
13:51.280 --> 13:52.480
Are you listening to me?

83
13:53.600 --> 13:56.280
Did anything happen to you last night?

84
13:57.680 --> 13:59.080
No. What about you?

85
14:02.840 --> 14:04.960
Xie Yudi always used to know where I was in the past.

86
14:06.320 --> 14:08.080
You were the one telling him, right?

87
14:08.160 --> 14:09.560
I don't like that.

88
14:12.960 --> 14:17.280
I was going to the campground last night,

89
14:18.080 --> 14:22.120
but I accidentally fell asleep in the activity room.

90
14:22.720 --> 14:27.160
Then it started raining outside, so I didn't go.

91
14:27.760 --> 14:30.000
And my phone was out of battery too.

92
14:30.640 --> 14:32.600
So what were you originally planning to tell me?

93
14:32.680 --> 14:36.080
I… I wanted to say…

94
14:41.760 --> 14:46.760
I lost some of the plants we were using for the specimens yesterday.

95
14:46.840 --> 14:47.680
I'm sorry.

96
14:48.400 --> 14:51.360
Why did you need to meet me outside just to tell me that?

97
14:53.760 --> 14:54.720
Because…

98
14:57.400 --> 14:58.280
Because…

99
15:01.000 --> 15:01.840
Forget it.

100
15:02.720 --> 15:03.640
It's fine.

101
15:06.680 --> 15:09.760
ANTIDIARRHEAL TABLETS

102
15:26.680 --> 15:27.920
-Zhou Ren. -Here.

103
15:29.680 --> 15:31.440
-Zhang Qi. -Here.

104
15:32.560 --> 15:34.080
-Chen Yanzhou. -Here.

105
15:34.960 --> 15:36.920
-Zheng Yu. -Here.

106
15:37.000 --> 15:38.280
Zhuang Ning.

107
15:41.360 --> 15:42.280
Is Zhuang Ning here?

108
15:44.160 --> 15:46.400
It rained all night yesterday.

109
15:46.480 --> 15:48.360
For everyone's safety,

110
15:48.440 --> 15:50.640
we decided at the last minute to hold class at the base.

111
15:51.240 --> 15:52.720
But none of you

112
15:52.800 --> 15:55.240
should be slacking off just because we're having the class here.

113
15:55.320 --> 15:58.480
-Where's Zhuang Ning? -I don't know.

114
16:04.080 --> 16:06.280
All right, that's all for today. Class dismissed.

115
16:07.640 --> 16:10.040
Wait, hold on a second!

116
16:10.120 --> 16:11.400
Don't rush off, everyone.

117
16:11.480 --> 16:12.600
Here's the thing.

118
16:13.120 --> 16:16.640
The lecturers just discussed it, and we're planning an activity

119
16:16.720 --> 16:18.880
to make up for not being able to get out in the field today.

120
16:18.960 --> 16:23.280
So I've prepared a few little games for you.

121
16:23.360 --> 16:25.360
The lecturers will chip in

122
16:25.440 --> 16:27.920
to prepare some red envelopes for the winners.

123
16:28.000 --> 16:28.880
-Nice! -Nice!

124
16:28.960 --> 16:32.160
So I hope everyone will participate this afternoon, all right?

125
16:32.240 --> 16:34.760
-All right! -All right!

126
16:34.840 --> 16:36.520
But. But!

127
16:36.600 --> 16:38.960
After lunch, we still have two classes.

128
16:40.480 --> 16:43.320
Our activity starts at four, okay?

129
16:43.400 --> 16:44.600
Four o'clock.

130
16:44.680 --> 16:47.520
-Okay. -Don't leave us hanging!

131
16:47.600 --> 16:50.520
Just leave the phone here. Someone will come looking for it.

132
16:51.600 --> 16:53.440
Or ask the students.

133
16:53.520 --> 16:54.960
You there.

134
16:55.640 --> 16:56.600
Come here.

135
16:58.960 --> 17:02.400
Our cleaning lady found a phone in the activity room.

136
17:02.480 --> 17:04.680
It's been there all morning, but no one's claimed it.

137
17:04.760 --> 17:07.040
Could you take a photo and post it in the class group chat?

138
17:11.040 --> 17:13.079
This phone looks like my roommate's.

139
17:13.160 --> 17:16.119
She was in the activity room last night, so she must've left it there.

140
17:16.200 --> 17:17.119
Last night?

141
17:17.200 --> 17:20.040
Do you mean the girl who got locked inside the activity room?

142
17:20.119 --> 17:21.640
What do you mean?

143
17:21.720 --> 17:24.040
There was a girl studying in there last night.

144
17:24.119 --> 17:25.920
She accidentally got locked inside.

145
17:26.599 --> 17:28.880
Who was the last person to check the room yesterday?

146
17:28.960 --> 17:30.080
Was it you?

147
17:30.160 --> 17:31.680
Didn't you see her?

148
17:31.760 --> 17:32.800
That can't be right.

149
17:33.400 --> 17:35.360
When I locked up, there was no one inside.

150
17:36.800 --> 17:39.040
Then a guy came by to borrow the key.

151
17:39.120 --> 17:41.160
He said he'd left something inside.

152
17:41.240 --> 17:43.080
But he didn't notice anyone in there either.

153
17:43.160 --> 17:44.760
ACADEMIC BUILDING

154
18:30.960 --> 18:32.560
All right. Everyone, settle down.

155
18:32.640 --> 18:34.400
Listen up.

156
18:34.480 --> 18:37.240
Since we have limited facilities up here,

157
18:37.320 --> 18:40.360
I've arranged a simple game for everyone to play.

158
18:40.440 --> 18:42.400
It's dodgeball.

159
18:42.480 --> 18:43.600
See these balloons?

160
18:43.680 --> 18:44.920
They're filled with water.

161
18:45.000 --> 18:47.640
-So today-- -I barely brought any clothes.

162
18:47.720 --> 18:49.760
-Yes, same here! -Same here!

163
18:50.400 --> 18:52.160
It's fine. The water's perfectly clean.

164
18:52.240 --> 18:54.520
I got it straight from the restroom.

165
18:54.600 --> 18:55.520
Look at him!

166
18:55.600 --> 18:58.080
Now, let me explain the rules.

167
18:58.160 --> 19:02.520
Each girl can choose a guy to play dodgeball with.

168
19:02.600 --> 19:07.080
You can decide among yourselves who throws and who dodges.

169
19:07.160 --> 19:09.160
So the person dodging

170
19:09.240 --> 19:12.520
must stay inside this circle while dodging.

171
19:12.600 --> 19:16.720
The thrower gets five attempts from the circle opposite.

172
19:16.800 --> 19:21.320
If the thrower hits the person dodging three times or more,

173
19:21.400 --> 19:23.160
the thrower wins a red envelope.

174
19:23.240 --> 19:24.600
The red envelope is right there!

175
19:24.680 --> 19:26.760
I have no idea how much is in it either, but it's a lot!

176
19:28.640 --> 19:30.240
So anyway,

177
19:30.320 --> 19:32.840
if the dodger avoids three or more hits,

178
19:32.920 --> 19:34.600
they will get a red envelope.

179
19:34.680 --> 19:35.520
Everyone understand?

180
19:35.600 --> 19:37.080
-Got it! -Let's get started!

181
19:37.160 --> 19:38.880
All right, let's begin!

182
19:38.960 --> 19:40.400
-Yes! -Let's go!

183
19:40.480 --> 19:41.640
Who's going first?

184
19:41.720 --> 19:42.920
Let's go by student number.

185
19:43.000 --> 19:46.360
-Me! -Class 1!

186
19:46.440 --> 19:48.240
-Class 2! -Let's go with Class 2!

187
19:48.960 --> 19:50.720
-Send someone up. -Linlin.

188
19:50.800 --> 19:51.640
Go on!

189
19:52.280 --> 19:53.560
Let's go!

190
19:53.640 --> 19:56.080
-Go! -I'm sending you down.

191
19:56.160 --> 19:57.560
Linlin!

192
19:57.640 --> 19:58.920
You got this!

193
19:59.000 --> 20:00.680
Everyone, a round of applause!

194
20:02.160 --> 20:03.200
Linlin, who will you pick?

195
20:05.760 --> 20:07.600
-How about you? -Me?

196
20:07.680 --> 20:09.520
-Good! -Good!

197
20:09.600 --> 20:10.440
All right!

198
20:12.800 --> 20:13.840
Come on.

199
20:14.840 --> 20:16.440
You got this, Linlin!

200
20:28.240 --> 20:29.320
Zhang Qi.

201
20:29.400 --> 20:31.520
Did you sneak in some practice while preparing the props?

202
20:32.600 --> 20:34.360
Then I won't hold back.

203
20:35.080 --> 20:36.720
All right, next up!

204
20:38.120 --> 20:39.280
I'll go!

205
20:45.360 --> 20:48.080
-You got this! -You got this!

206
20:59.480 --> 21:00.440
Sorry, sir!

207
21:01.040 --> 21:02.040
Go for it!

208
21:05.480 --> 21:07.000
You got this!

209
21:07.080 --> 21:10.240
-You can do it! -You got this!

210
21:10.320 --> 21:11.320
Come on!

211
21:11.400 --> 21:14.480
You got this!

212
21:24.120 --> 21:24.960
Good job!

213
21:25.040 --> 21:27.040
-Well done! -All right, next up!

214
21:34.680 --> 21:37.240
-This guy is relentless! -Not gentlemanly at all!

215
21:37.320 --> 21:38.880
Exactly!

216
21:44.920 --> 21:45.920
Pick me.

217
21:46.000 --> 21:48.120
That way, no matter who wins, we'll get the red envelope.

218
21:49.680 --> 21:51.120
Don't you believe we both can win?

219
22:01.080 --> 22:02.840
Come on, girls!

220
22:02.920 --> 22:05.720
Work harder, or the boys will take all the red envelopes!

221
22:05.800 --> 22:07.400
It's all down to skill!

222
22:07.480 --> 22:09.560
Next up, Zheng Yu.

223
22:10.360 --> 22:12.040
Come on, Zheng Yu!

224
22:12.120 --> 22:14.720
-Come on! -You got this!

225
22:14.800 --> 22:15.960
Who will you pick?

226
22:19.920 --> 22:21.120
Xie Yudi.

227
22:24.480 --> 22:25.640
She picked him?

228
22:25.720 --> 22:28.120
What's going on? Is your luck finally turning around?

229
22:28.760 --> 22:30.680
Seriously?

230
22:30.760 --> 22:32.400
So do you want to throw or dodge?

231
22:38.040 --> 22:44.240
-Go for it! -Go for it!

232
22:44.320 --> 22:47.840
-Go for it! -You can do this!

233
22:48.480 --> 22:49.880
-Come on! -You got this!

234
22:49.960 --> 22:52.360
-Go for it! -Go for it!

235
22:56.400 --> 22:57.920
Oh gosh.

236
23:00.800 --> 23:02.440
Zheng Yu!

237
23:04.200 --> 23:06.480
Hey, Xie Yudi. Don't go easy on her!

238
23:06.560 --> 23:08.200
Yes, don't hold back!

239
23:28.000 --> 23:30.120
-Go for it, Zheng Yu! -Hey, Xie Yudi!

240
23:30.200 --> 23:31.160
I've figured it out.

241
23:31.240 --> 23:33.600
Don't just move your upper body. You need to move your feet too!

242
23:33.680 --> 23:34.920
That's right!

243
23:35.000 --> 23:35.840
Got it.

244
23:36.400 --> 23:37.360
It's just a game.

245
23:51.720 --> 23:54.080
Yes! We've hit him three times!

246
23:54.160 --> 23:57.880
-Zheng Yu wins! -She won!

247
23:57.960 --> 23:59.840
-Zheng Yu! Zheng Yu! -Should we keep going?

248
23:59.920 --> 24:01.000
Of course!

249
24:01.080 --> 24:02.760
Everyone's already thrown all five balls.

250
24:02.840 --> 24:07.280
Keep going! Keep going! Keep going!

251
24:51.040 --> 24:54.800
-We take the win! -Zheng Yu!

252
24:54.880 --> 24:57.240
Zheng Yu!

253
24:58.880 --> 25:01.840
Zheng Yu!

254
25:03.320 --> 25:05.360
Zheng Yu, you won!

255
25:06.040 --> 25:07.000
Zheng Yu!

256
25:07.080 --> 25:08.960
Xie Yudi, the water's really clean.

257
25:09.040 --> 25:10.600
It's safe to drink. It's fine.

258
25:10.680 --> 25:13.200
Zheng Yu!

259
25:14.640 --> 25:16.560
That was amazing!

260
25:16.640 --> 25:20.160
-Zheng Yu! -She's incredible!

261
25:26.600 --> 25:32.400
Zheng Yu! Zheng Yu! Zheng Yu!

262
26:12.800 --> 26:13.880
What's wrong?

263
26:15.880 --> 26:16.880
You're burning up.

264
26:17.880 --> 26:20.080
Let's go to the hospital. I'll call the group leader.

265
26:21.080 --> 26:22.400
Bo's luck is unbelievably bad.

266
26:22.480 --> 26:25.600
-Someone's coming. -As if your luck was any better.

267
26:30.560 --> 26:31.760
Let's play another round later.

268
26:31.840 --> 26:33.400
-I can't believe this. -We'll see later.

269
26:33.480 --> 26:34.600
It's Zhang Qi.

270
26:36.240 --> 26:37.400
Who are you sharing a room with?

271
26:38.960 --> 26:39.800
I…

272
26:42.080 --> 26:43.560
Chen Yanzhou.

273
26:43.640 --> 26:45.000
We're going out to eat.

274
26:45.080 --> 26:47.560
There's a farmhouse restaurant nearby. Want to come with us?

275
26:51.920 --> 26:52.920
That's strange.

276
26:53.000 --> 26:55.040
He's not in the room or out in the courtyard.

277
26:56.040 --> 26:57.160
Where else could he be?

278
26:57.760 --> 26:58.760
I'll go check inside.

279
26:58.840 --> 27:00.680
You're sharing a room with Zhang Qi?

280
27:06.040 --> 27:07.760
Where's my key card?

281
27:09.120 --> 27:10.480
Did I leave it in the room?

282
27:11.920 --> 27:13.760
I'll get another one from the front desk.

283
27:14.440 --> 27:17.960
Maybe he's in the room, but he just doesn't want to deal with you.

284
27:18.040 --> 27:20.280
Everyone supported the game you organized this afternoon,

285
27:20.360 --> 27:21.640
but he was nowhere to be seen.

286
27:21.720 --> 27:24.400
If he's too good to hang out with us, why bother chasing after him?

287
27:25.480 --> 27:27.400
Don't say it like that.

288
27:27.480 --> 27:28.800
Let's go!

289
27:28.880 --> 27:30.840
If we don't hurry, we'll be stuck with leftovers.

290
27:36.800 --> 27:38.600
You'll suffocate me before the illness gets me.

291
27:42.520 --> 27:43.360
Zheng Yu.

292
27:43.920 --> 27:46.840
We're just classmates hanging out. Why are you acting so guilty?

293
27:47.440 --> 27:50.360
If certain people saw us, who knows what they'd think?

294
27:51.120 --> 27:52.320
Certain people?

295
27:52.400 --> 27:53.240
Who?

296
27:53.760 --> 27:54.640
Xie Yudi?

297
28:05.400 --> 28:08.840
You were the one who borrowed my equipment for light trapping yesterday, right?

298
28:08.920 --> 28:11.440
You were fine yesterday. How did you get a fever today?

299
28:12.080 --> 28:13.000
He got caught in the rain.

300
28:14.400 --> 28:17.360
The hospital is too far from here. Driving on the mountain roads is tricky.

301
28:17.440 --> 28:20.040
I'll take you to the local health center for a checkup first.

302
28:20.120 --> 28:22.000
-Thank you for your help. -It's fine.

303
28:22.080 --> 28:24.160
You two just have terrible timing.

304
28:24.240 --> 28:27.160
Your group leader, Mr. Sun, went to a nearby farm restaurant

305
28:27.240 --> 28:30.280
to catch the students who sneaked out for a late-night meal.

306
28:30.360 --> 28:31.360
This isn't like the city.

307
28:31.440 --> 28:32.640
You can't just hail a cab.

308
28:32.720 --> 28:35.120
Luckily, I was on night duty. It's just a quick drive.

309
28:37.160 --> 28:38.200
Is he okay?

310
28:41.840 --> 28:44.120
That's how mountain roads are. They're bumpy when it rains.

311
28:44.200 --> 28:45.320
Just focus on driving.

312
29:38.840 --> 29:41.280
WESTERN MEDICINE PHARMACY, PAYMENTS/BILLING

313
29:44.640 --> 29:45.480
Doctor.

314
29:47.480 --> 29:48.520
What's the problem?

315
29:48.600 --> 29:51.240
He got caught in the rain last night and developed a fever.

316
29:51.320 --> 29:53.120
Come with me then. I'll take your temperature.

317
30:01.920 --> 30:03.200
It's 38.6 degrees.

318
30:03.920 --> 30:05.920
I'll give you an IV drip and prescribe some medicine.

319
30:11.200 --> 30:12.640
XIE YUDI

320
30:15.040 --> 30:16.240
Do you have any allergies?

321
30:16.960 --> 30:20.080
I'm allergic to eggs. I took some allergy meds for it recently.

322
30:20.160 --> 30:21.080
What did you take?

323
30:25.480 --> 30:26.520
All right.

324
30:30.800 --> 30:32.040
You're allergic to eggs?

325
30:36.400 --> 30:37.520
I wasn't before.

326
30:38.120 --> 30:39.640
After I got sick,

327
30:40.240 --> 30:41.680
I suddenly discovered it one day.

328
30:41.760 --> 30:43.320
At your house last time,

329
30:43.400 --> 30:45.320
you seemed to love the scrambled eggs.

330
30:47.840 --> 30:50.120
We don't waste food in my family.

331
30:50.800 --> 30:52.000
Chen Yanzhou.

332
30:56.560 --> 30:57.440
I just…

333
30:58.240 --> 30:59.760
didn't want to disappoint the cook.

334
31:03.320 --> 31:05.720
Even if you want to take care of your sick mom,

335
31:05.800 --> 31:07.720
you shouldn't treat yourself this way.

336
31:11.960 --> 31:14.520
By the way, during the game today,

337
31:15.520 --> 31:16.840
why did you choose Xie Yudi?

338
31:18.120 --> 31:20.120
I had no idea you two were so close.

339
31:24.320 --> 31:25.560
I'll take this call.

340
31:51.800 --> 31:53.240
Lean back and get some rest.

341
31:54.640 --> 31:56.040
I'm not sleepy.

342
31:56.960 --> 32:00.120
Besides, someone has to keep an eye on the IV drip

343
32:00.200 --> 32:01.520
to see when it finishes.

344
32:02.360 --> 32:03.280
Don't worry.

345
32:03.360 --> 32:05.760
I've spoken to the doctor. He'll keep an eye on it.

346
32:06.440 --> 32:07.560
Get some sleep.

347
32:07.640 --> 32:09.120
I have something to do. I'll just--

348
32:09.200 --> 32:11.720
I understand. Go ahead.

349
33:18.800 --> 33:20.120
You're awake.

350
33:20.200 --> 33:22.000
Yes. I'm awake.

351
33:22.080 --> 33:23.160
You…

352
33:26.320 --> 33:27.480
Your fever's gone down.

353
33:33.800 --> 33:35.840
You don't need to take this box. Take this one instead.

354
33:40.520 --> 33:42.240
You didn't leave last night?

355
33:42.320 --> 33:43.360
Leave?

356
33:43.440 --> 33:44.720
Where would I go?

357
33:44.800 --> 33:47.920
You took a call yesterday and said you had to return to the base.

358
33:48.000 --> 33:49.480
I did get a call.

359
33:49.560 --> 33:50.960
It was from a biotech company.

360
33:51.040 --> 33:53.720
They said they had some urgent documents to translate.

361
33:54.640 --> 33:57.200
So… you stayed here all night?

362
34:02.040 --> 34:04.400
It was raining last night, and the temperature dropped.

363
34:04.480 --> 34:05.840
Why didn't you sit inside?

364
34:06.440 --> 34:09.040
I had to call the biotech company to go over the documents.

365
34:09.120 --> 34:10.400
I didn't want to disturb you.

366
34:12.320 --> 34:13.159
Let's go.

367
34:13.239 --> 34:16.000
Let's get back and grab a bite before you take your medicine.

368
34:32.600 --> 34:33.639
Can you believe this?

369
34:33.719 --> 34:35.880
We've only just got here, and now we're leaving.

370
34:35.960 --> 34:37.960
Are we the unluckiest class ever?

371
34:38.040 --> 34:39.679
Last year, the base was under maintenance.

372
34:39.760 --> 34:42.480
This year, they scheduled it to avoid overlapping with the sophomores,

373
34:42.560 --> 34:44.600
but they got the weather wrong.

374
34:45.199 --> 34:46.040
Seriously…

375
34:46.120 --> 34:46.960
Everyone.

376
34:47.040 --> 34:49.840
Our ride should arrive in about 40 minutes.

377
34:49.920 --> 34:52.120
Since the rain has stopped, let's hurry down the mountain.

378
34:52.199 --> 34:53.639
Has everyone packed their bags?

379
34:53.719 --> 34:55.199
-Yes! -Yes!

380
34:55.280 --> 34:56.880
Sir, some people are still packing inside.

381
34:56.960 --> 34:58.360
-They're not done yet? -Yes.

382
34:58.440 --> 35:00.280
Come on. Let's go hurry them along.

383
35:01.320 --> 35:02.920
I don't really want to go back.

384
35:17.360 --> 35:18.520
Where's your roommate?

385
35:18.600 --> 35:19.840
Still packing?

386
35:24.680 --> 35:25.640
What's going on here?

387
35:25.720 --> 35:27.920
Exactly. Just got back from a walk?

388
35:28.000 --> 35:31.000
Could they be one of the few who escaped last night's farmhouse restaurant raid?

389
35:31.080 --> 35:32.760
They sure know how to hide!

390
35:32.840 --> 35:35.440
Looks like they were out all night. They haven't changed clothes.

391
35:35.520 --> 35:37.320
Isn't that a little too blatant?

392
35:37.400 --> 35:38.680
You're so clueless.

393
35:38.760 --> 35:40.760
Those two got together at the end of last semester.

394
35:40.840 --> 35:41.720
Can't you tell?

395
35:44.000 --> 35:44.880
Holy crap!

396
35:47.680 --> 35:49.560
-Whose car is this? -Whose car is this?

397
35:51.440 --> 35:54.000
Don't tell me this is the ride Mr. Sun arranged for us.

398
36:11.360 --> 36:12.840
Dad, what are you doing here?

399
36:12.920 --> 36:15.160
Your group leader told me everything that happened.

400
36:16.400 --> 36:17.480
You have to understand.

401
36:18.400 --> 36:20.680
A high fever can trigger a recurrence of myocarditis.

402
36:20.760 --> 36:23.000
Your lecturers were worried something might happen.

403
36:23.720 --> 36:25.200
They didn't want to be held responsible.

404
36:25.760 --> 36:28.160
I've already told you I'm fine. Feel for yourself.

405
36:31.520 --> 36:33.640
I still think you're a little warm.

406
36:34.760 --> 36:36.960
Your hand isn't as reliable as a hospital thermometer.

407
36:37.800 --> 36:40.880
Who would've thought? Chen Yanzhou comes from a rich family.

408
36:40.960 --> 36:43.560
As if being rich weren't enough, he gets good grades too.

409
36:43.640 --> 36:45.560
And girls like him too.

410
36:46.240 --> 36:47.440
Did you see that?

411
36:47.520 --> 36:49.520
Chen Yanzhou's dad greeted Zheng Yu.

412
36:49.600 --> 36:50.560
Did he?

413
36:51.720 --> 36:54.240
Of course he did! Those four eyes of yours are useless.

414
37:17.960 --> 37:20.160
Dr. Lin's specialist appointment was fully booked today,

415
37:20.240 --> 37:22.160
so I booked one for tomorrow.

416
37:22.240 --> 37:23.400
Either way,

417
37:24.240 --> 37:25.920
you need to get checked.

418
37:27.960 --> 37:28.800
Got it.

419
37:29.400 --> 37:30.720
Dad, do you have a charging cable?

420
37:30.800 --> 37:33.520
Staring at your phone in the car strains your eyes.

421
37:33.600 --> 37:35.560
If it's dead, just leave it dead.

422
37:36.720 --> 37:38.280
I need to let my classmate know.

423
37:38.360 --> 37:39.720
I left before I could tell them.

424
37:40.320 --> 37:42.680
What kind of classmate requires you to report in like this?

425
37:44.680 --> 37:45.520
Help yourself.

426
37:47.360 --> 37:49.040
CIGARETTES

427
38:04.680 --> 38:07.280
What's wrong? Is your classmate mad at you?

428
38:11.000 --> 38:12.080
It hasn't even turned on yet.

429
38:28.960 --> 38:29.840
Are you okay?

430
38:30.400 --> 38:31.480
I'm fine.

431
38:38.920 --> 38:40.440
What time did Zheng Yu leave last night?

432
38:42.120 --> 38:43.080
I'm not sure.

433
38:43.160 --> 38:44.320
We had a falling out,

434
38:44.400 --> 38:46.600
so I got back to my room really late last night.

435
38:46.680 --> 38:48.040
With a personality like yours,

436
38:48.120 --> 38:49.800
how do you even manage to have a falling out?

437
38:51.560 --> 38:53.840
She thought I was the one who sent that text.

438
38:54.360 --> 38:55.920
She thinks I'm disgusting.

439
38:57.120 --> 38:59.800
So don't ask me about her anymore,

440
39:00.440 --> 39:02.920
and don't try to use me to do anything for her either,

441
39:03.000 --> 39:04.440
because she won't fall for it again.

442
39:07.800 --> 39:12.360
Everyone, check with your group members to make sure everyone's here.

443
39:12.440 --> 39:14.280
Sir, Zhuang Ning is still not here.

444
39:16.120 --> 39:18.040
Zhuang Ning? Isn't she right over there?

445
39:22.240 --> 39:23.280
I didn't see her just now.

446
39:23.960 --> 39:25.520
Okay, sit properly and settle down.

447
39:28.800 --> 39:29.920
I'm leaving first.

448
39:30.000 --> 39:30.960
CHEN YANZHOU

449
39:37.480 --> 39:38.400
They really fell out?

450
39:45.640 --> 39:48.400
LIYUAN BUILDING 9

451
39:51.120 --> 39:55.120
Should we explain in more detail how we identified the insect order?

452
39:55.720 --> 39:58.320
But too much text will affect the layout.

453
39:59.440 --> 40:00.680
Linlin.

454
40:00.760 --> 40:04.320
My report is missing a few insect photos.

455
40:04.400 --> 40:06.480
Did you take any? Could you send me a few?

456
40:07.760 --> 40:09.520
Didn't Zheng Yu do the light trapping?

457
40:09.600 --> 40:10.800
She should have those photos.

458
40:13.640 --> 40:16.080
Just leave that part blank. I'll handle it later.

459
40:16.680 --> 40:18.120
It's fine. I can finish it myself.

460
40:19.360 --> 40:22.080
That's Chen Yanzhou's section. You don't need to do it.

461
40:26.320 --> 40:27.480
What's going on with them?

462
40:31.720 --> 40:34.600
Everyone, I have a suggestion.

463
40:34.680 --> 40:38.520
After our fieldwork presentations, let's have a dorm dinner together.

464
40:39.360 --> 40:40.240
My treat!

465
40:40.320 --> 40:41.320
Sounds good!

466
40:41.400 --> 40:44.080
Didn't Zhuang Ning say at the end of last semester

467
40:44.160 --> 40:45.680
that we'd never had a dorm dinner?

468
40:46.760 --> 40:49.920
A new place just opened at Paradise Walk. It's only two stops away.

469
40:50.000 --> 40:51.720
Why don't we book a table there?

470
40:52.560 --> 40:54.680
-I'm busy. -I want to rest after the presentation.

471
41:42.160 --> 41:43.000
Ms. Yang.

472
41:45.440 --> 41:46.360
Xiaochen.

473
41:53.080 --> 41:55.000
What bad timing.

474
41:55.080 --> 41:56.160
Zheng Yu isn't here today.

475
41:57.240 --> 41:59.040
I know. I'm not here to see her.

476
42:00.280 --> 42:02.400
I've caught a bit of a cold, so I came for medicine.

477
42:02.480 --> 42:04.440
I happened to see someone drinking this.

478
42:10.960 --> 42:11.800
There's more.

479
42:14.760 --> 42:15.720
This…

480
42:15.800 --> 42:18.400
Please don't tell her. I don't want her to get the wrong idea.

481
42:18.480 --> 42:20.880
I brought these for you. It has nothing to do with her.

482
42:20.960 --> 42:23.600
Since you put it that way, I'll keep it a secret.

483
42:24.240 --> 42:25.440
I need to take a picture.

484
42:25.520 --> 42:27.280
I was just wondering what to post today.

485
42:28.240 --> 42:29.640
What do you mean?

486
42:29.720 --> 42:32.200
I have an account where I share bits of my life.

487
42:32.280 --> 42:33.480
I have quite a lot of followers.

488
42:37.560 --> 42:38.920
Where did my phone go?

489
42:42.320 --> 42:44.200
I probably left it at the nurses' station.

490
42:44.280 --> 42:45.880
My memory's getting worse and worse.

491
42:45.960 --> 42:46.840
Want me to get it--

492
42:46.920 --> 42:48.640
No, no. You stay there.

493
42:48.720 --> 42:51.200
I'll get it myself. We still need to add each other on WeChat.

494
42:52.160 --> 42:53.000
Sure.

495
46:18.360 --> 46:23.360
Subtitle translation by: Cempaka Malinja
